  "title": "Create workflow"
 },
 "description": "Create and persist one workflow as an additive write without activating its triggers. name, nodes, and connections define a new record; nodes and connections must form one complete graph, while omitting settings uses an empty object. Optional pinData, staticData, description, and nodeGroups are forwarded only when supplied. Use n8n_workflows_update for an existing workflow and activate for triggers. Requires write or unsafe mode plus create permission; returns the validated projection without pin/static values.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
